ered the preceding questions the way you did?","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Can you briefly explain why you answered the preceding questions the way you did?","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Can you briefly explain why you answered the preceding questions the way you did?","DataExportTag":"Q63","QuestionID":"QID63"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID64","SecondaryAttribute":"In this study, we will ask you whether God could bring about certain events or states of affairs...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"In this study, we will ask you whether God could bring about certain events or states of affairs -- that is whether it is even&nbsp;<em>possible<\/em>&nbsp;that God could bring about certain events.&nbsp;<div><div><br><\/div><div>We are&nbsp;<strong>NOT&nbsp;<\/strong>asking you to judge whether God&nbsp;<strong>WOULD&nbsp;<\/strong>actually make these events occur, just whether God could.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><div><br><\/div><div><u>For the purposes of the study, we ask that you please assume&nbsp;that God exists whether you are religious or not.<\/u><\/div><div><br><\/div>\n\n<div>Please keep this in mind when answering the questions that follow. &nbsp;<\/div><\/div><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this study, we will ask you whether God could bring about certain events or states of affairs...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In this study, we will ask you whether God could bring about certain events or states of affairs -- that is whether it is even&nbsp;<em>possible<\/em>&nbsp;that God could bring about certain events.&nbsp;<div><div><br><\/div><div>We are&nbsp;<strong>NOT&nbsp;<\/strong>asking you to judge whether God&nbsp;<strong>WOULD&nbsp;<\/strong>actually make these events occur, just whether God could.&nbsp;<\/div><div><br><\/div><div><div><br><\/div><div><u>For the purposes of the study, we ask that you please assume&nbsp;that God exists whether you are religious or not.<\/u><\/div><div><br><\/div>\n\n<div>Please keep this in mind when answering the questions that follow. &nbsp;<\/div><\/div><\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q64","QuestionID":"QID64"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID67","SecondaryAttribute":"Tror du p\u00e5 Gud?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Tror du p\u00e5 Gud?","DataExportTag":"Belief_in_God","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Tror du p\u00e5 Gud?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ja"},"2":{"Display":"Nej"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID67","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID68","SecondaryAttribute":"OBS \u00a0 Du bliver i unders\u00f8gelsen ikke bedt om at vurdere, om disse **begivenheder** faktisk ville..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size:19px;\"><u><b>OBS<\/b><\/u><\/span><\/div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Du bliver i unders\u00f8gelsen ikke bedt om at vurdere, om disse **begivenheder** faktisk ville finde sted. [We are not asking you to judge whether these events would actually occur.]<span style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;\">&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Du bliver bedt om at vurdere, om disse begivenheder kunne finde sted, eller om Gud kunne f\u00e5 dem til at finde sted.&nbsp;[We are asking whether these events&nbsp;<u><strong>could<\/strong><\/u>&nbsp;occur, or whether God&nbsp;<u><strong>could<\/strong><\/u>&nbsp;make them occur.]<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q56","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"OBS \u00a0 Du bliver i unders\u00f8gelsen ikke bedt om at vurdere, om disse **begivenheder** faktisk ville...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID68","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID69","SecondaryAttribute":"I de sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l, der omhandler Gud, bliver du bedt om at antage, at Gud findes, uanset om du er re.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"I de sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l, der omhandler Gud, bliver du bedt om at antage, at Gud findes, uanset om du er religi\u00f8s eller ej. Det er muligt, at du er uenig i denne antagelse,&nbsp;men det er udelukkende med henblik p\u00e5 at besvare dette sp\u00f8rgeskema.<br>[For the questions concerning God, we ask that you please suppose that God exists whether you are religious or not. We understand that you might disagree with this supposition but it is just for the purposes of answering questions in the survey.]<br><br>Venligst fors\u00f8g at have denne antagelse for \u00f8je, n\u00e5r du besvarer sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5lene, selv hvis du er uenig i den.\n[Please do your best to keep this in mind as you complete the study&nbsp;even if you disagree with this supposition.]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q57","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"I de sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l, der omhandler Gud, bliver du bedt om at antage, at Gud findes, uanset om du er re...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID69","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID7","SecondaryAttribute":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt at stj\u00e6le fra de fattige? [Is it possible for it to.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt  at stj\u00e6le fra de fattige? [Is it possible for it to be morally right to steal from the poor?]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"B_Steal","QuestionID":"QID7","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt at stj\u00e6le fra de fattige? [Is it possible for it to...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ja"},"2":{"Display":"Nej"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID70","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q58","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":5,"MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID70"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID71","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q59","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":5,"MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID71"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID72","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Timing","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q60","QuestionType":"Timing","Selector":"PageTimer","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","MinSeconds":5,"MaxSeconds":"0"},"QuestionDescription":"Timing","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"First Click"},"2":{"Display":"Last Click"},"3":{"Display":"Page Submit"},"4":{"Display":"Click Count"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID72"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID73","SecondaryAttribute":"Tak for at gennemf\u00f8re sp\u00f8rgeskemaet! [Thank you for completing this survey!]\u00a0 Der er kun nogle f","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Tak for at gennemf\u00f8re sp\u00f8rgeskemaet! [Thank you for completing this survey!]&nbsp;<br>Der er kun nogle f\u00e5 sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l tilbage. [We have only a few more questions for you.]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q62","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Tak for at gennemf\u00f8re sp\u00f8rgeskemaet! [Thank you for completing this survey!]\u00a0 Der er kun nogle f\u00e5...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID73","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID74","SecondaryAttribute":"Hvordan n\u00e5ede du frem til dine svar? Hvad var din tankeproces bag? [How did you make your choices..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Hvordan n\u00e5ede&nbsp;du frem til dine svar? Hvad var din tankeproces bag? [How did you make your choices? What was your thought process?]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q64","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Hvordan n\u00e5ede du frem til dine svar? Hvad var din tankeproces bag? [How did you make your choices...","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID74","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID75","SecondaryAttribute":"Har du nogle kommentarer til vores studie\/sp\u00f8rgeskema? [Do you have any comments about the study?]","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Har du nogle kommentarer til vores studie\/sp\u00f8rgeskema? [Do you have any comments about the study?]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q66","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"ML","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Har du nogle kommentarer til vores studie\/sp\u00f8rgeskema? [Do you have any comments about the study?]","Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID75","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID76","SecondaryAttribute":"Er du en mand eller en kvinde?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er du en mand eller en kvinde?","DataExportTag":"Q68","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er du en mand eller en kvinde?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Mand"},"2":{"Display":"Kvinde"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID76","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID77","SecondaryAttribute":" ","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q70","QuestionType":"TE","Selector":"FORM","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":" ","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Alder [Age]","TextEntry":"on","TextEntryValidation":"ValidNumber"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID77","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":2,"NextAnswerId":1,"SearchSource":{"AllowFreeResponse":"false"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID78","SecondaryAttribute":"Venligst v\u00e6r \u00e6rlig, n\u00e5r du besvarer det f\u00f8lgende sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l. Dit svar vil ikke p\u00e5virke din mul","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Venligst v\u00e6r \u00e6rlig, n\u00e5r du besvarer det f\u00f8lgende sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l. <b>Dit svar vil ikke p\u00e5virke din mulighed for deltage i fremtidige unders\u00f8gelser.&nbsp;<\/b>[Please be honest when answering the following question.&nbsp;<b>Your answer will not affect your payment or eligibility for future studies.]<\/b><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Den unders\u00f8gelse, som du lige har deltaget i, er en psykologisk unders\u00f8gelse, der har til form\u00e5l at forst\u00e5 menneskets tankem\u00f8nstre og adf\u00e6rd. Psykologisk forskning er afh\u00e6ngig af deltagere som dig. Dine svar p\u00e5 unders\u00f8gelser som denne er en utrolig v\u00e6rdifuld kilde til data for forskere i psykologi. Det er derfor vigtigt for kvaliteten af forskningen, at deltagere er opm\u00e6rksomme, undg\u00e5r distraktioner og tager alle dele af unders\u00f8gelsen seri\u00f8st (selv n\u00e5r de m\u00e5tte virke fjollede). [The study you have just participated in is a psychological study aimed at understanding human cognition and behavior. Psychological research depends on participants like you. Your responses to surveys like this one are an incredibly valuable source of data for researchers. It is therefore crucial for research that participants pay attention, avoid distractions, and take all study tasks seriously (even when they might seem silly).]<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><b>Mener du, at du har v\u00e6ret opm\u00e6rksom, undg\u00e5et distraktioner og taget denne unders\u00f8gelse seri\u00f8st? [Do you feel that you paid attention, avoided distractions, and took this survey seriously?]<\/b><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q72","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Venligst v\u00e6r \u00e6rlig, n\u00e5r du besvarer det f\u00f8lgende sp\u00f8rgsm\u00e5l. Dit svar vil ikke p\u00e5virke din mulighe...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Nej, jeg blev distraheret undervejs. [No, I was distracted.]"},"2":{"Display":"Nej, jeg havde sv\u00e6rt ved at holde opm\u00e6rksomheden. [No, I had trouble paying attention.]"},"3":{"Display":"Nej, jeg tog ikke dette sp\u00f8rgeskema seri\u00f8st. [No, I did not take this survey seriously.]"},"4":{"Display":"Nej, noget andet p\u00e5virkede min deltagelse negativt. [No, something else affected my participation negatively.]"},"5":{"Display":"Ja. [Yes.]"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,"3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID78","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"RecodeValues":{"1":"0","2":"0","3":"0","4":"0","5":"1"},"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID79","SecondaryAttribute":"DEBRIEFING: INFORMATION OM STUDIET \u00a0 Forskningsbeskrivelse \u00a0 Vi unders\u00f8ger i dette projekt de kog","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>DEBRIEFING: INFORMATION OM STUDIET<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><\/p>Forskningsbeskrivelse<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Vi unders\u00f8ger i dette projekt de kognitive processer, der ligger til grund for hvordan vi mennesker t\u00e6nker over moral. Vi har en hypotese om at overvejelser omkring Guds almagt kan p\u00e5virke vores intuitioner om grundl\u00e6ggende moralske p\u00e5stande. Mere specifikt havde vi en hypotese om at mennesker mener det er umuligt at \u00e6ndre fundamentale moralske sandheder\u2014det vil sige, at det er umuligt at moralsk forkerte handlinger nogensinde kan blive i orden, og at moralsk rigtige handlinger kan blive forkerte. Ikke desto mindre mener folk ogs\u00e5 at Gud kunne \u00e6ndre sandhedsv\u00e6rdierne af disse samme p\u00e5stande, uanset deres egne religi\u00f8se overbevisninger. [This project investigates the cognitive processes that underlie how people reason about morality. We hypothesize that considering God\u2019s omnipotence may affect people\u2019s intuitions about basic moral claims. Specifically, we hypothesized that people think it is impossible to alter foundational moral truths\u2014that is, it is impossible for moral wrongs to ever be right and for moral rights to be wrong. Yet, people also maintain that God could change the truth-values of these same propositions, regardless of their own religious views.]<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Goodwin, G.P., &amp; Darley, J.M. (2008). The psychology of meta-ethics: Exploring objectivism. Cognition, 106(3): 1339-1366.<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">Goodwin, G.P., &amp; Darley, J.M. (2012). Why are some moral beliefs perceived to be more&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"margin-left: 40px;\">objective than others? Journal of Experimental Social Psychology, 48(1): 250-256.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Dine data er anonyme; de vil blive opbevaret p\u00e5 en sikker server og arkiveret. [Your data are anonymous; they will be kept on a secure server and archived.]<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>Tak endnu en gang for din deltagelse i vores studie. Du vil blive krediteret inden for de n\u00e6ste 72 timer. [Thank you once again for your involvement in our study. You will be credited within the next 72 hours.]<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q74","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"DEBRIEFING: INFORMATION OM STUDIET \u00a0 Forskningsbeskrivelse \u00a0 Vi unders\u00f8ger i dette projekt de kog...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID79","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID8","SecondaryAttribute":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt at voldtage nogen? [Is it possible for it to be mor..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt  at voldtage nogen? [Is it possible for it to be morally right to rape someone?]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"B_Rape","QuestionID":"QID8","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er det muligt for det at v\u00e6re moralsk rigtigt at voldtage nogen? [Is it possible for it to be mor...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ja"},"2":{"Display":"Nej"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"RequestResponse","ForceResponseType":"RequestResponse","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID80","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q68","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID80"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID81","SecondaryAttribute":"Consent Form You are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being condu...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Consent Form<\/strong><\/div>\nYou are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being conducted by Dr. Zachary Horne, a faculty member at Arizona State University. You must be 18 years or older to participate in this study.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThis is a survey study. This study requires paying attention and answering some short questionnaires. This survey is anonymous.&nbsp; No one, including the researcher, will be able to associate your responses with your identity<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThe survey should take about 15 minutes to complete and you will be compensated $<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThe purpose of this study is to learn more about how people think about what is possible and impossible. In this survey, you will read short descriptions of various people and respond to questions about them. You will also answer some general questions about your demographics.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nYou will need to complete all of the pages in order to complete the study but you may skip particular questions. If you do not wish to answer the questions, you may withdraw from the study at any time without penalty.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nYour agreement to participate is indicated by clicking the link and beginning the study.<br>\n&nbsp;<br>\nThis study has been reviewed and approved by the Arizona State University Institutional Review Board. If you have any questions about your rights as a participant in this research, or if you feel you have been placed at risk, you can contact the Institutional Review Board, through the ASU Office of Research Integrity and Assurance, at (480) 965-6788. If there is anything about the study participation that is unclear or that you do not understand, or if you have questions or wish to report a research-related problem, you may contact Dr. Zachary Horne at Zachary.Horne@asu.edu.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q70","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Consent Form You are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being condu...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID81","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID82","SecondaryAttribute":"Do you consent to participate in the study?","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Do you consent to participate in the study?","DataExportTag":"Q72","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Do you consent to participate in the study?","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Yes"},"2":{"Display":"No"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID82","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID83","SecondaryAttribute":"Consent Form\u00a0 You are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being cond..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Consent Form&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p>You are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being conducted by Dr. Zachary Horne, Assistant Professor at Arizona State University. You must be 18 years or older to participate in this study. <\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>This is a survey study. This study requires paying attention and answering some short questionnaires. This survey is anonymous.&nbsp; No one, including the researcher, will be able to associate your responses with your identity. This study involves considering text that may be upsetting or controversial to some people so keep this in mind before agreeing to participate in the study. Beyond reading some potentially upsetting information, there are no risks associated with participating in the study.&nbsp; <\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>The survey should take about 15 minutes to complete and you will be compensated $0.60 for participating in the study. <\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>The purpose of this study is to learn about how people make judgments and decisions about issues that concern morality and religion. In this survey, you will read short sentences about morality and have to make a judgment about whether you think a statement is true or false. You will also answer some general questions about your opinions, preferences, and demographics. <\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>You will need to complete all of the pages in order to complete the study but you may skip particular questions. If you do not wish to answer the questions, you may withdraw from the study at any time without penalty. <\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>Your agreement to participate is indicated by clicking the link and beginning the study.<\/p>\n\n<p><br><\/p><p>This study has been reviewed and approved by the Arizona State University Institutional Review Board. If you have any questions about your rights as a participant in this research, or if you feel you have been placed at risk, you can contact the Institutional Review Board, through the ASU Office of Research Integrity and Assurance, at (480) 965-6788. If there is anything about the study participation that is unclear or that you do not understand, or if you have questions or wish to report a research-related problem, you may contact Dr. Zachary Horne at Zachary.Horne@asu.edu.&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q71","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Consent Form\u00a0 You are being asked to participate in a survey research project which is being cond...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID83","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID84","SecondaryAttribute":"Er det muligt for et gram at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for an ounce to weigh mor...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er det muligt for et gram at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for an ounce to weigh more than a pound?]","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q72","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er det muligt for et gram at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for an ounce to weigh mor...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ja"},"2":{"Display":"Nej"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID84","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID85","SecondaryAttribute":"Er det muligt for Gud at f\u00e5 et gram til at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for God to...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er det muligt for Gud at f\u00e5 et gram til at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for God to make an ounce weigh more than a pound?]","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er det muligt for Gud at f\u00e5 et gram til at veje mere end et kilogram? [Is it possible for God to...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Ja"},"2":{"Display":"Nej"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Is it possible for an ounce to weigh more than a pound?","DataExportTag":"Q85","QuestionID":"QID85","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"NextChoiceId":3,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_07oqgMElI4TGVv0","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID86","SecondaryAttribute":"Er det muligt for et hus at eksistere og ikke eksistere p\u00e5 samme tid? [Is it possible for a house..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Er det muligt for et hus at eksistere og ikke eksistere p\u00e5 samme tid?&nbsp;[Is it possible for a house to both exist and not exist at the same time?]","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Er det muligt for et hus at eksistere og ikke eksistere p\u00e5 samme tid? [Is it possible for a house...","Cho